{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_ceylon_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_ceylon_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "留下的人",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ceylon_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "84f3eb1b3517f5eb0bd61e0f23b97d938927fa8104213bdeb8279257b4109bc4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的不能通融一下嗎，主任？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沙漏，你應該比我更清楚，感染者的遺體是不可能被帶出去舉行葬禮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那骨灰呢，骨灰應該可以吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……即使是骨灰，也需要經過特殊處理，確認無風險之後才能取出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "辦事處剛建立沒多久，這方面的設施功能還很不完善。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就算我現在立刻提出申請，從本艦審核到器材運到，至少也需要半年的時間吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……你知道這有多殘忍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我身為她的主治醫師和唯一的親友，卻沒能在最後一刻守在她身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在那之後，她的遺體就被隔離了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而現在，我想要拿到她的骨灰，竟然需要申請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這份申請還沒有辦法立刻通過！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "拜託你，別讓我為難，沙漏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些規定每一條你都知道來由，甚至其中有一些是我們一起制定的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "主任，我為羅德島工作了一年，這是我唯一的請求……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒辦法在她活著的時候陪她去旅行，至少在她死後……我想帶著她的骨灰出去走一走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是她最後的願望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們是醫生，我們必須對其他人負責，沙漏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醫生就必須扼殺自己的私情嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別逼我和你吵架，沙漏……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道你很難過，我也——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果未來，黑小姐也迎來了這一天……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也能像現在這樣用規定來說服自己嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊終端提示聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "遺體處理即將開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊終端提示聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "請負責人認證識別碼後進入焚化室開始處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所有的遺體處理都要由辦事處的主任，也就是我經手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你願意的話，這次我可以破例交給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我能做的……只有這樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒有在她生命的最後一刻見到她，也沒辦法實現她的願望，我沒有臉去見她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "換上了全套防護裝備的錫蘭，熟練地拉過躺著迪麗雅遺體的推車，向著焚化設備推去。\n時至今日，她已經習慣了見到和處理感染者的屍體。\n雖然每一次都會讓她心中絞痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙漏的語氣中帶著明顯的怨懟，但錫蘭並沒有因此感到不滿。\n她的立場讓她必須承受這些怨氣，在她決定幫助羅德島建立這個辦事處時，她就已經做好了心理準備。\n至於這個問題——\n“我和黑會怎麼樣，不用你來擔心！”\n她差點下意識這樣反駁，但她當然不能。\n就像她也絕不會輕易地對沙漏說：“我理解你的痛苦。”\n然而，無論沙漏是以什麼樣的心情問出那句話的，至少在過去的無數個夜晚，錫蘭已經為那種可能哭了太多次。\n但每一次，她都會擦乾眼淚，然後繼續看文獻和寫報告。\n眼淚沒有研究成果和特效藥有用，她是這麼相信的。\n假設有一天，躺在眼前這輛推車上的是黑，而推著車的是其他人，那只有可能是她在尋找救治黑的方法的路上被困住了。\n而如果真的發生了那樣的事，她想她會接受的。\n我已經為此拚盡全力了。她想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對不起，迪麗雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們總是無法兩全其美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她將推車上的遺體推入焚化設備中。\n沉默片刻，她按下了按鈕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……晚安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她其實不喜歡海，她說，從小看到大，早就看膩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她一直想去旅行，總說等到存夠了錢就去，但最後也沒去成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我已經冷靜下來了，剛才很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒事的，你能理解就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "過幾天，我會為迪麗雅舉辦一場葬禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你已經安排好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，她的後事我早就安排好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "即使沒有她的骨灰，葬禮也會照常舉行，我今天只是想最後再爭取一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你沒有任何需要說抱歉的地方，我知道你也很難過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是……人在這種時候，總是會沒那麼理智。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你會來參加葬禮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾天後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "從風情街到沙灘的道路是用花朵鋪成的，道路的兩邊擺著巨大的花籃。\n在道路的盡頭，有一個臨時搭建的小型宴會場地，那裡布置了一個舞台，台下整齊地擺放著十幾張椅子。\n舞台的牆上，高高掛著一張迪麗雅的照片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬禮司儀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "迪麗雅女士的父母早亡，而她在感染礦石病後也孑然一身，身邊稱得上摯友的只有一人，那就是蕾娜塔女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬禮司儀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "接下來，我們有請蕾娜塔女士發表悼辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬禮司儀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳，出於一些特殊原因，蕾娜塔女士不方便露面，我們將透過廣播的形式播放她的悼辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在我痛恨著周遭的一切，想要讓大海帶走自己時，我在海邊遇到了正在跳舞賣藝的迪麗雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "迪麗雅似乎看出了我的心事，在我的面前跳了一支舞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我永遠記得那支舞，迪麗雅在沙灘上不停地旋轉、跳躍，帶起的裙擺在陽光下熠熠生輝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而這些天，我的腦海中，全都是那支舞，我怎麼樣也忘不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我將與她有關的回憶整理成相冊，我以為我已經做得足夠多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我以為我已經為她的離開做好了充足的心理準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，在我不知道第幾次從夢中驚醒卻意識到她已不在時，我發現，我做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是那麼地想要再次見到她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "錫蘭感到格外地傷感，她無法想像如果有一天，輪到自己經歷這一切，自己能否承受得住。\n黑還有時間，她知道自己並不能真正與沙漏感同身受。\n然而，光是在無數個夜晚中，那些不可遏制的幻想所帶來的惶恐，足以在此時與沙漏所描繪的痛苦重合，撬開她本就脆弱的心防。\n她想見到沙漏，她想和沙漏聊一聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "司儀先生，請問，沙漏……蕾娜塔女士她現在在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬禮司儀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是她的上司，您可以信任我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬禮司儀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……好吧。她剛才將錄音交給我之後就不知道去哪裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……我來了，迪麗雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "結果，我還是騙了主任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這點小伎倆肯定很快就會被識破吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，只要一下子就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要一下子，足夠我帶走你，足夠我們離開這裡，足夠我們遠走高飛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我會帶你去我們曾經一起去過的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也會帶你一起去你曾經想去，但最終沒有去成的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然後，我們找個能夠欣賞日落的地方安靜地生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙漏一邊自言自語，一邊在存放骨灰的櫃子上尋找著迪麗雅的名字。\n她在這裡當了一年的醫生，也治療過不少病人，看著一個個熟悉的名字從眼前劃過，她感到自己的手在微微顫抖。\n最終，她找到了迪麗雅的名字。\n櫃子的位置有點高，她只能從旁邊拉一張椅子過來，椅子和地板摩擦發出的吱呀聲在房間中迴盪，讓她的心跳漏了幾拍。\n她踩上椅子，顫抖著將鑰匙插向寫著迪麗雅名字的櫃子鑰匙孔。\n但或許是淚水模糊了視線，又或者是她的手抖得太厲害了，她怎麼也插不進那個鑰匙孔。\n她就這樣試了一次、兩次、許多次。\n直到淚流滿面。\n直到鑰匙從手中滑落。\n直到她因為想去接鑰匙而從椅子上摔下。\n直到她神情恍惚地癱坐在地上。\n直到她嚎啕大哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對不起，迪麗雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對不起……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是我，你們有見到沙漏嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事處幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咦，主任，你不是剛剛才讓沙漏過來取走迪麗雅女士的骨灰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她現在人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事處幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "剛才她一邊哭一邊離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在立刻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事處幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咦，怪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事處幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是這樣的，主任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事處幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "因為我看她樣子很奇怪，所以她走後我也想過來看看到底什麼情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事處幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沙漏沒帶走迪麗雅女士的骨灰啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦事處幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，看起來她甚至沒有打開過櫃子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……我馬上回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是怎麼跳的來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我記得她教過我的。應該是這樣，先轉一個圈，然後再轉一個——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，我還是這麼笨手笨腳的，永遠不能像你那樣跳出熱烈的舞蹈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沙漏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是怎麼找到這裡的，主任？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的錄音裡提到了你們第一次相遇的海灘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我以前也常來這裡玩，一下子就聽出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……對不起，主任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在你參加葬禮的時候，偷偷用了你的許可證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這種小事……好吧，這確實不算小事。但是，為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "主任，你覺得，怎樣才算是為摯愛之人的離世做好了準備？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你說，你會為了不讓她離開而拚盡全力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而我，我記錄下了有關她的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，結果呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "結果她離開後，我沒有一夜能夠安穩入睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "最後，甚至鋌而走險，打算偷走她的骨灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你為什麼又放棄了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在我看到存放她骨灰的櫃子時，我就已經知道，我在做的事情是那麼沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想帶走的又怎麼會是她的骨灰呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是無論如何都想要再見她一面，而這種無論如何，在最後化作了那樣愚蠢的行為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在那一刻醒悟的只有一件事，那就是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她永遠都不會回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒能做好任何準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我又怎麼可能做好準備呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "錫蘭緩緩走到沙漏身邊坐下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在我很小的時候，父親工作總是很忙，於是黑自然而然成了我的保鏢兼玩伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那個時候，我最喜歡做的事情，就是從家裡溜出去，向著火山的方向走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我從來沒有成功過，因為每次我都會在半路被黑攔下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過，黑每次攔住我的地方，周圍都會有一些好玩或者有趣的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "於是，我就會順勢在那裡玩個痛快，然後跟著黑回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那個時候，我以為，這樣的時光可以永遠持續下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "直到我知道了礦石病是一種什麼樣的病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "於是我立下志向，未來，我一定要治好黑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果真要比較的話，我其實比你還要自私。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是，對我來說，如果有一個機會能夠治好她，我一定會去抓住它，哪怕這樣會犧牲我和她相處的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想，這樣的話，至少在最後的時刻，我可以寬慰自己——我為她付出了我所有的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，就像你說的，你錯了，我也錯了。面對至親之人的離世，我們做的任何準備都沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我剛才在葬禮上，光是聽你說的那些就已經受不了了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果黑離開我的那一天真的到來……我大概只會比你更瘋狂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "曾經的我又何嘗不是呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在真正面對死亡帶來的離別之前，我們每個人都是一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "自大、盲目，以為自己能夠撐下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "死亡並不只是帶走了一個人的生命，它也會帶走和這個人最親密的人的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們將永遠殘缺地活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果，我是說如果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你真的帶走了她的骨灰，你打算去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我……會和她的骨灰一起去旅行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想和她一起走一遍我們曾經走過的土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想帶著她的骨灰前往我們還沒來得及一起去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是……這也只是我的一廂情願而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我說，去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒有告訴其他人是你盜用了我的許可證，名義上，你現在依然擁有帶走迪麗雅骨灰的許可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我會回一趟本艦，正式提出申請，為你獲得旅行的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然，作為懲罰，我會扣掉你半年的薪水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "以及，新汐斯塔還沒有適合的保存容器，我也會請工程部想想辦法，準備好適合的容器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這至少比等機器運過來花的時間要少一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是，你去每一個地方都要和附近的羅德島辦事處打個招呼，我也會讓他們檢查你的容器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一旦發生危險情況，或者發現你將她的骨灰撒在了什麼地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你就完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，除此之外，我也會讓他們配合你，你想去什麼地方祭奠迪麗雅都是你的自由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……已經沒有意義了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們錯了，但是——我們真的錯了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "面對死亡，我們做了一切我們能做的掙扎，如果離別不可避免，如果殘缺終將發生——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那麼，那個人留下的痕跡，我想，是唯一能夠讓我們稍微填補殘缺的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……抱歉，看起來好像理解你一樣地說了這樣一些話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們的立場不同、狀況也不同，我沒有資格命令你做任何事。我只是在想，未來，如果屬於我的那一天也終於到來了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我一定也會和你一樣，重新走過每一個我們曾經共同留下痕跡的地方，在那些地方大哭一場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等我哭完了、嗓子啞了、淚流乾了，我再去想別的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果連這樣都沒有辦法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "到時候，我們再來聊一聊吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝謝你，主任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不保證我能像你說的那樣堅強……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，我可以試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Medic，我的情況怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "和去年相比，有些發展的傾向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不太妙，你這兩年作為教官和幹員活動得有點太頻繁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我會和上面申請，減輕你的工作負擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我的調任申請——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你回到新汐斯塔後，肯定會繼續勉強自己吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我會好好休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "騙人，你都已經來羅德島兩年了，大家都瞭解你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你啊，還是太不會照顧自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然讓錫蘭照顧你是最適合的，但新汐斯塔辦事處現在才剛起步，至少也要等一年再讓你回去我們才放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就讓我來本艦照顧黑好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小姐？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，錫蘭，你這就回來啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我還想說給黑一個驚喜呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，那我不是打斷你了？不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "門外的錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再來一次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳。不過，黑，你也不用太擔心，針對你的情況，我們有一個更好的解決方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鏘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒錯，在你回來後沒多久，錫蘭主動申請返回本艦待一段時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好啦，問題解決。你們聊吧，我就不打擾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃，小姐……你不是要在新汐斯塔大展拳腳嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我和父親聊了聊，他同意在一些事情上給羅德島開綠燈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那邊我暫時不在也沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我這邊也不用你擔心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你剛才絕對在想怎麼對我隱瞞病情吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那倒是……沒有。反正你總會知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼，這還差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Medic說得對，你確實需要一些休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以，我們去旅行吧，黑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我忽然想起來，你以前和我說過你出生的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但我還從來沒有去過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那裡……沒留下什麼東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但我們可以在那裡留下些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且，雖然我知道你當傭兵時的經歷，但你還沒說過你的童年呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……怎麼了，小姐，這麼突然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是忽然覺得，你看著我長大，對我的一切都瞭如指掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我卻還沒有完全瞭解你的過去，這可不公平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我可是個很貪心的人，黑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "知道就好。現在，讓我看看你的體檢報告。然後，我們再來制定一下旅行計劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
